{
  "videoId": "C008",
  "title": "小包装更贵",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "sceneId": "S01",
      "narrationSegment": "你有没有发现，同一种零食，小包装单价常常比大包装更贵？明明买得少，按克数算却更不划算。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "thinking",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "钱袋",
          "enterFrom": "right",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 0.0
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S02",
      "narrationSegment": "原因之一是包装成本。一个大袋子和几个小袋子，装的东西差不多，但小包装需要更多封口、标签和运输空间。比如一包50克的小包装要5.5块，同样的量拆成小包反而更贵。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "explaining",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "钱袋",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "overlay",
          "kind": "vs-card",
          "text": "50克 vs 5.5块",
          "title": "对比一下",
          "position": "top"
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 9.706
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S03",
      "narrationSegment": "还有一个原因是便利费。小包装更容易携带、分享和控制分量，很多人愿意为这种方便多付一点钱。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "钱袋",
          "enterFrom": "right",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 27.411
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S04",
      "narrationSegment": "所以买东西不能只看包装上的总价，要把价格除以重量，比较每一百克到底多少钱。比如小包装100克卖9.9块，大包装100克只要7.5块，差的这2.4块，就是包装和便利的成本。大包装也不一定更省，还要看你能不能吃完。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "confused",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "钱袋",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "overlay",
          "kind": "vs-card",
          "text": "9.9块 vs 7.5块",
          "title": "对比一下",
          "position": "top"
        },
        {
          "type": "overlay",
          "kind": "equation",
          "text": "总价 ÷ 重量 = 单价",
          "title": "算一算",
          "position": "bottom"
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 37.339
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S05",
      "narrationSegment": "记住一句话，划算要看单位价格，省钱也要看实际用量。你觉得买大包还是买小包更划算？评论区站队。",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小布丁",
          "emotion": "worried",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "工资条",
          "enterFrom": "right",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 60.822
    }
  ]
}